window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Can love claim a person by force?</b></p> <p>Phaedra's worst fear has been confirmed: She's a vampire's mate. But just because he needs her doesn't mean she needs or wants him, right? Then why can't she stop worrying about Syn and whatever he's up to with her sister? She should feel betrayed, but being able to sense the vampire's emotions make her doubt everything she thought she knew. Still, there are bigger worries to consider—like how to escape a self-obsessed sorcerer, or to come to terms with her long-lost sister being a creature of evil. Some things you can't change, a fact Phaedra had long accepted as true. But she's amazed to discover that she isn't as unchangeable as she thought.</p> <p>Some things still surprise her, it seems, and it looks like love is one of them.</p> <p><b>Fae Wilds Series</b></p> <ul> <li>Twist &amp; Turns</li> <li>Curse of the Fae</li> <li>Force the Truth</li> <li>Crown &amp; Glory</li> <li>Enemy &amp; Rivals</li> <li>Light in the Dark</li> <li>Dusk and Shadows</li> <li>Called by Midnight</li> <li>Dark Memories</li> <li>Above the Curse</li> <li>Myths and Muses</li> <li>Chase and Hunt</li> </ul> <p><i>USA Today Bestselling Author, W.J. May creates a new paranormal series with a world of Fae and Magic. Escape into a realm of fantasy creatures, love and deception, betrayal and jealousy. A coming of age paranormal mini part series that'll keep you listening late into the night!</i></p>"; 
